	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Gratias summas maximasque habeo et ago tibi, vir clarissime, pro tua illa erga me humanitate, qua <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>fit, ut, quae describenda petam, non deneges, procul dubio ratiocinans multum aliquando re<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ferre, ut, quae huiusmodi sunt, in promptu habeantur in nostris ecclesiis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ea ergo, quae <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>proxime miseras, descripta iam remitto, et utinam haberem etiam d. <persName ref="p8417">Musculi</persName> de causa Ser<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>vetana scriptum, cuius mentionem feceras in tuis literis.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Cuperem insuper habere responsiones <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><placeName ref="l41">Bernatium</placeName> et <placeName ref="l28">Basiliensium</placeName> de consistorio <placeName ref="l167">Genevensi</placeName> sive excommunicatione ecclesiastica; studeo enim <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>talia (praesertim si religionem et ministerium concernunt) colligere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Rumor ad nos pervenit <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>de tumultu <placeName ref="l830">Anglico</placeName>, ibi enim trucidatos aliquot <placeName>Hispanos</placeName>, reginam nusquam esse tutam, <placeName ref="l830">Anglos</placeName> nolle <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>omnino pro rege agnoscere <persName>Philippum</persName>, Caesaris filium, velle eos puram et illibatam evangelicam religionem etc., <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>de quibus omnibus te certa habiturum arbitror rogoque, ut, si habes, ea mihi communicare digneris; <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ego nihil habeo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Caeterum revocare cogor, quae proxime scripseram de emptione, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>solutione et debito nepotis tui, id quod factum est ex nimia festinatione et pravo intellectu; emit <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>400 pellices, <foreign xml:lang="de">wyß und schwarz kröpf, 50 fechbelgli; solvit 8 coronatos, restant 16 fl. <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>solvendi ad nundinas <placeName ref="l586">Zurzachenses</placeName>.</foreign></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ita vere se habet res, id quod ex nepote inetellexti sine dubio; <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>numerasset equidem plures coronatos, sed leviores erant.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale ergo, vir humanissime, et <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>nequid aegre feras meque tibi semper commendatum habeas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Rediit d. <persName ref="p2553">Peyerus</persName> ex <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName>; <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>si quae fuerint nova, arbitramur te ipso ex <placeName ref="l832">Gallo</placeName> ea percepturum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Cremantur quotidie <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>christiani in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale iterum.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/><persName ref="p3964">Winzürnius</persName> extorsit literas commendaticias <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>a patre <placeName ref="l1558">Ittingensi</placeName> ad magistratum nostrum; tales sibi eligit patronos et advocatos, inde aestimandus, qualis sit etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/><placeName ref="l441">Scaphusiae</placeName> 21. februarii 1554.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Tuae humanitati deditissimus <lb xml:id="p1z25"/><persName ref="p2757">Iacobus Ruͤger</persName>.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Dem erwürdigen und hoch<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>gelerthen herren meyster <persName ref="p495">Hein<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>rychen Bullinger</persName>, pfarrherren <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>zum Grossen Münster zuͦ <lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>, sinem fründtlichen, lieben <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>herren und bruͦder zhanden.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
